Input: {"question": "Which sports team does Simon Enqvist represent or represent?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 191, "text": "As the sun dipped behind the Rocky Mountains, casting a warm orange glow over the University of Wyoming's campus, Simon Enqvist laced up his sneakers and made his way to the Arena-Auditorium."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 192, "end": 302, "text": "The Finnish footballer, known for his lightning-fast footwork on the pitch, had a secret passion - basketball."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 303, "end": 388, "text": "And not just any basketball, but the fast-paced, rugged style of the Wyoming Cowboys."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 389, "end": 488, "text": "Simon's teammates, a motley crew of ranchers' sons and small-town heroes, eyed him warily at first."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 489, "end": 610, "text": "What could a soccer player from Finland possibly know about the rough-and-tumble world of Mountain West Conference hoops?"}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 611, "end": 674, "text": "But Simon's quiet confidence and work ethic soon won them over."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 675, "end": 761, "text": "He spent hours in the gym, honing his jump shot and perfecting his pick-and-roll game."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 762, "end": 929, "text": "As he took the court for the Cowboys' evening practice, Simon's eyes locked onto the towering figure of Coach Shyatt, a grizzled veteran of the college coaching ranks."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 930, "end": 1107, "text": "Shyatt's gruff demeanor and sharp wit had earned him a reputation as one of the toughest coaches in the conference, but Simon sensed a kindred spirit beneath the gruff exterior."}, "D1S10": {"docu