hours kicking the ball around with his friends, dreaming of one day becoming a professional footballer."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 894, "end": 944, "text": "As Simon's skills improved, so did his reputation."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 945, "end": 1073, "text": "He began to make a name for himself in local youth leagues, catching the attention of coaches and scouts from across the region."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1074, "end": 1190, "text": "It wasn't long before Simon's talent and hard work earned him a spot on the roster of IFK Mariehamn's youth academy."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1191, "end": 1341, "text": "Under the guidance of experienced coaches and trainers, Simon honed his craft, refining his technique and developing a deep understanding of the game."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1342, "end": 1482, "text": "He quickly became a standout player, known for his lightning-quick speed, razor-sharp instincts, and unwavering commitment to his teammates."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1483, "end": 1517, "text": "As Simon matured, so did his game."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1518, "end": 1639, "text": "He began to make appearances for IFK Mariehamn's reserve team, where he continued to impress with his skill and tenacity."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1640, "end": 1760, "text": "It was only a matter of time before he would be called up to the senior squad, and in 2018, that moment finally arrived."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1761, "end": 1924, "text": "On a crisp autumn evening, Simon Enqvist made his professional debut for IFK Mariehamn, taking to the pitch in front of a packed crowd at the Wiklöf Holding Arena."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1925, "end": 2036, 